flowchart TD
    SRA[SplitOS Release Authority] --> SE[Signed SplitOS Release / Knowledge Envelope]
    SE --> SU[SplitOS Update Channel]
    SU --> SO[SplitOS Update Orchestration]

    MS[Microsoft Update Source] --> WUA[Windows Update / Supported Microsoft Servicing]
    AP[SplitOS Windows Patch Approval Metadata] --> WC[Windows Servicing Coordinator]
    WUA --> WC

    SO --> G{Major mutation gate}
    WC --> G
    G -->|SplitOS wrapper window| SP[Stage / Capsule / Activate SplitOS Release]
    G -->|Approved Windows servicing window| WP[Install Microsoft-signed approved patch]

    SP --> V[Verify installed SplitOS release]
    WP --> C[Refresh Windows build + SplitOS compatibility]
    C --> V
